WEBVTT

00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:01.976
I met another young 26-year-old,

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.016
white seminary and college student

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:09.400
named Jonathan Daniels,
from Cambridge, Massachusetts.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:11.400
He and I

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:18.120
were both part of a generation
of idealistic young people,

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:23.096
whose life has been ignited

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:25.576
by the freedom fire

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:30.576
that ordinary black people
were spreading around the nation